      "spam": false,
      "value": "As an addendum, it would be nice if eye tracking wasn't leashed to the Humanoid rigging as well.  Divorcing both Visemes and eye bone movement from this rig requirement would be really beneficial for a wide variety of reasons.",
      "viewerReactions": null
